# NOTE: authored for the org CI runners; NOT built/validated in this workspace.
# libubootenv (fw_printenv/fw_setenv, the "u-boot-fw-utils" tools)
# configuration — must match the env location U-Boot is built with
# (rauc-bootmeth.cfg: env file "uboot.env" on mmc 0:1) and the runtime
# mount of that FAT partition at /boot/firmware
# (rofs-overlays boot-firmware.mount).
#
# Used by RAUC's uboot bootloader backend and by atomic-health's
# fw_setenv BOOT_${slot}_LEFT reset (design.md §7.2, §7.4).
#
# Device name                 Offset   Env size
/boot/firmware/uboot.env      0x0000   0x4000
